  "post_content": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\" wfd-id=\"4\">El grup scout Sant&iacute;ssim Salvador d&#39;Onda&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\" wfd-id=\"3\">est&agrave; realitzant durant tota la setmana (tamb&eacute; dissabte i diumenge) un campament urb&agrave;, ja que no ha pogut fer-se l&#39;acam</span><span class=\"text_exposed_show\" style=\"display: inline; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);\" wfd-id=\"2\">pada d&#39;estiu com a conseq&uuml;&egrave;ncia de la pand&egrave;mia Covid-19.</span></p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/campamenturbascoutjuliol2020/img_20200721_091028.jpg\" alt=\"img_20200721_091028\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/campamenturbascoutjuliol2020/img_20200721_091036.jpg\" alt=\"img_20200721_091036\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/campamenturbascoutjuliol2020/img_20200721_091043.jpg\" alt=\"img_20200721_091043\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/campamenturbascoutjuliol2020/img_20200721_091246.jpg\" alt=\"img_20200721_091246\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/campamenturbascoutjuliol2020/img_20200721_091257.jpg\" alt=\"img_20200721_091257\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/campamenturbascoutjuliol2020/img_20200721_091300.jpg\" alt=\"img_20200721_091300\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/campamenturbascoutjuliol2020/img_20200721_091329.jpg\" alt=\"img_20200721_091329